UID:0cxlX4jrl6MhMvUR_N2HZ
SUMMARY:Houston Texans Huddle Against Hunger\, presented by Kroger 2025 – 2
	026 end-of-year Scavenger Hunt
DTSTAMP:20260730T055259Z
DTSTART:20260730T113000Z
DESCRIPTION:July 30th (11:30am – 1:30pm) the children from HYPE Freedom Sch
	ool will be at Kroger on Buffalo Speedway to participate in Houston Texans
	 Huddle Against Hunger\, presented by Kroger 2025 – 2026 end-of-year Scave
	nger Hunt.  The children split into 4 or 5 teams will compete in a Kroger 
	shopping scavenger hunt searching for healthy food options. Assisted by a 
	Texans Legend\, Texans Players\, Texans Cheerleaders and TORO the students
	 will add to their shopping baskets nutritional options from a list and ra
	ce to be the first to locate all items. \nHouston Texans Huddle Against Hu
	nger\, presented by Kroger program was developed in partnership with the H
	ouston Food Bank and the Texans and it is designed to help students better
	 understand issues around food insecurity\, hunger\, and the importance of
	 nutrition.\n\nhttps://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/houston-texan
	s-huddle-against-hunger-presented-by-kroger-2025-2026-end-of-year-scavenge
	r-hunt/\n\nFrom Houston Food Bank
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/houston-texans-huddle-aga
	inst-hunger-presented-by-kroger-2025-2026-end-of-year-scavenger-hunt/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-food-bank
CATEGORIES:Houston Food Bank
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
